Dialogue: 99,0:00:16.66,0:00:19.04,Dialogue,Oliver,0,0,0,,Lady Rishe, are you awake?
Dialogue: 99,0:00:19.71,0:00:21.46,Dialogue,Oliver,0,0,0,,I'm Prince Arnold's aide, Oliver.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:21.67,0:00:24.30,Dialogue,Rishe,0,0,0,,Y-Yes! Just a moment, please!
Dialogue: 99,0:00:28.42,0:00:30.22,Dialogue,Rishe,0,0,0,,Thank you for waiting.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:30.22,0:00:31.68,Dialogue,Oliver,0,0,0,,My apologies.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:31.89,0:00:35.52,Dialogue,Oliver,0,0,0,,This is the only time I could manage \Nto get away from the prince's office.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:36.60,0:00:38.77,Dialogue,Rishe,0,0,0,,Then, you haven't managed any rest?
Dialogue: 99,0:00:39.19,0:00:41.31,Dialogue,Oliver,0,0,0,,I'm better off than others are.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:41.31,0:00:44.57,Dialogue,Oliver,0,0,0,,Prince Arnold hasn't managed even a nap.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:45.11,0:00:48.78,Dialogue,Oliver,0,0,0,,He's been hard-pressed to complete the work \Nthat accumulated while he was away in Hermity.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:49.32,0:00:51.41,Dialogue,Rishe,0,0,0,,I feel I should apologize.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:51.66,0:00:52.45,Dialogue,Oliver,0,0,0,,Not at all.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:52.87,0:00:55.41,Dialogue,Oliver,0,0,0,,The prince said he had no intention to marry,
Dialogue: 99,0:00:55.79,0:00:58.50,Dialogue,Oliver,0,0,0,,but through these events,\Nhe's found a lady to be his wife.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:03.17,0:01:05.88,Dialogue,Rishe,0,0,0,,Please look as much as you'd like.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:06.09,0:01:07.17,Dialogue,Oliver,0,0,0,,Pardon?
Dialogue: 99,0:01:07.17,0:01:09.55,Dialogue,Rishe,0,0,0,,You were examining me, weren't you?
Dialogue: 99,0:01:10.76,0:01:12.76,Dialogue,Oliver,0,0,0,,My apologies! That was terribly rude of me.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:13.51,0:01:17.14,Dialogue,Oliver,0,0,0,,Your insight is just as keen \Nas the prince said it is.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:17.14,0:01:21.64,Dialogue,Rishe,0,0,0,,Master Oliver, your worry for \NHis Highness truly is heartfelt.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:21.89,0:01:24.27,Dialogue,Rishe,0,0,0,,Have you been with him long?
Dialogue: 99,0:01:24.27,0:01:25.69,Dialogue,Oliver,0,0,0,,It's been ten years.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:26.15,0:01:28.61,Dialogue,Rishe,0,0,0,,If you've served him for that long,
Dialogue: 99,0:01:28.99,0:01:33.49,Dialogue,Rishe,0,0,0,,then would you know why he \Nhas decided to marry me?
Dialogue: 99,0:01:33.74,0:01:37.95,Dialogue,Oliver,0,0,0,,Well, to be honest, I'm \Nsurprised by it as well.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:38.66,0:01:42.25,Dialogue,Oliver,0,0,0,,However, I've never seen the prince so happy.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:42.62,0:01:46.34,Dialogue,Oliver,0,0,0,,When he's with you, Lady Rishe, \Nhis smile is so honest and open.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:46.34,0:01:49.34,Dialogue,Rishe,0,0,0,,I feel I'm being treated as some sort of toy.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:50.76,0:01:52.80,Dialogue,Rishe; internal,0,0,0,,{\i1}He isn't denying it.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:53.43,0:01:55.64,Dialogue,Oliver,0,0,0,,I didn't mean to get \Nabsorbed in conversation.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:55.64,0:02:00.31,Dialogue,Oliver,0,0,0,,His Highness asked me to bring you a list of \Nthe honored guests for the wedding ceremony.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:00.77,0:02:02.69,Dialogue,Rishe,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:02.69,0:02:05.86,Dialogue,Rishe; internal,0,0,0,,{\i1}Princess Harriet of Siguel.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:05.86,0:02:09.65,Dialogue,Rishe; internal,0,0,0,,{\i1}Duke Jonal will be in attendance \Nto represent the Kingdom of Domana.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:09.65,0:02:12.57,Dialogue,Rishe; internal,0,0,0,,{\i1}And Prince Kyle of Coyolles...
Dialogue: 99,0:02:13.07,0:02:16.57,Dialogue,Oliver,0,0,0,,And this is a list of attendees \Nfor the party tomorrow evening.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:18.99,0:02:20.41,Dialogue,Rishe,0,0,0,,The party?
Dialogue: 99,0:04:06.10,0:04:08.56,Dialogue,Elsie,0,0,0,,Um, Miss Diana, where do these go?
Dialogue: 99,0:04:08.56,0:04:11.98,Dialogue,Diana,0,0,0,,Go and line them up the way I \Nshowed you yesterday please.
Dialogue: 99,0:04:11.98,0:04:12.57,Dialogue,Elsie,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 99,0:04:12.57,0:04:14.28,Dialogue,Diana,0,0,0,,I'm in the middle of something right now.
Dialogue: 99,0:04:19.82,0:04:21.07,Dialogue,Rishe,0,0,0,,It's Rishe.
Dialogue: 99,0:04:21.07,0:04:24.54,Dialogue,Rishe,0,0,0,,Your Highness, may I have \Na moment of your time?
Dialogue: 99,0:04:24.54,0:04:25.37,Dialogue,Arnold,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 99,0:04:30.25,0:04:33.79,Dialogue,Rishe,0,0,0,,Prince Arnold, I've come \Nto beg something of you.
Dialogue: 99,0:04:33.79,0:04:36.80,Dialogue,Rishe,0,0,0,,You did tell me to think \Nof something, didn't you?
Dialogue: 99,0:04:37.22,0:04:39.13,Dialogue,Arnold,0,0,0,,Think of something you want.
Dialogue: 99,0:04:40.01,0:04:42.89,Dialogue,Arnold,0,0,0,,My agreement not to lay a finger on you.
Dialogue: 99,0:04:42.89,0:04:45.22,Dialogue,Arnold,0,0,0,,This time, I truly did break it.
Dialogue: 99,0:04:45.72,0:04:49.89,Dialogue,Rishe,0,0,0,,Would it be possible to leave the \Nselection of my maids to me?
Dialogue: 99,0:04:49.89,0:04:52.61,Dialogue,Arnold,0,0,0,,You can do as you like with that, but...
Dialogue: 99,0:04:57.44,0:04:59.78,Dialogue,Arnold,0,0,0,,It seems Oliver didn't tell you.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:00.91,0:05:02.32,Dialogue,Arnold,0,0,0,,This party tonight...
Dialogue: 99,0:05:02.32,0:05:06.04,Dialogue,Arnold,0,0,0,,It's meant to say, "The crown prince is \Nlooking for someone to marry from the empire."
Dialogue: 99,0:05:06.04,0:05:09.75,Dialogue,Arnold,0,0,0,,It's a pointless pretense\Nheld to keep up appearances.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:09.75,0:05:11.04,Dialogue,Rishe,0,0,0,,Your Highness,
Dialogue: 99,0:05:11.04,0:05:15.80,Dialogue,Rishe,0,0,0,,in this country, I am the crown \Nprincess only as a hostage.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:16.71,0:05:19.92,Dialogue,Rishe,0,0,0,,However, I find no dishonor in that.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:21.22,0:05:22.22,Dialogue,Rishe,0,0,0,,Please,
Dialogue: 99,0:05:22.93,0:05:25.51,Dialogue,Rishe,0,0,0,,feel free to formally reveal \Nyour fiancée at the party.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:30.14,0:05:31.73,Dialogue,Arnold,0,0,0,,I suppose I have no choice.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:31.73,0:05:34.48,Dialogue,Arnold,0,0,0,,Especially as I've received \Nyour permission to touch you.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:34.48,0:05:37.32,Dialogue,Rishe,0,0,0,,Well, we are both wearing gloves after all.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:56.88,0:06:01.05,Dialogue,Rishe,0,0,0,,This seems to be a much grander \Nevent than I'd anticipated.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:01.05,0:06:03.26,Dialogue,Arnold,0,0,0,,This is still on the smaller side.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:03.26,0:06:05.30,Dialogue,Rishe,0,0,0,,The standards of a large \Ncountry are different.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:05.72,0:06:07.43,Dialogue,noble 1,0,0,0,,Prince Arnold!
Dialogue: 99,0:06:07.43,0:06:10.77,Dialogue,noble 1,0,0,0,,I was honored to receive an \Ninvitation to attend this evening!
Dialogue: 99,0:06:10.77,0:06:12.94,Dialogue,Arnold,0,0,0,,Thank you for coming.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:13.19,0:06:17.69,Dialogue,noble 2,0,0,0,,Your Highness, please tell my \Ndaughter stories of your travels.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:17.69,0:06:21.69,Dialogue,Arnold,0,0,0,,Unfortunately, there aren't any points \Nworth speaking of on their own,
Dialogue: 99,0:06:22.24,0:06:25.49,Dialogue,Arnold,0,0,0,,but I did find good fortune on my trip.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:27.03,0:06:30.08,Dialogue,Arnold,0,0,0,,As you can see, I've found \Nsomeone to be my wife.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:31.04,0:06:32.29,Dialogue,girl 2,0,0,0,,Did he say wife?
Dialogue: 99,0:06:32.29,0:06:34.08,Dialogue,girl 1,0,0,0,,His Highness is smiling!
Dialogue: 99,0:06:34.08,0:06:37.38,Dialogue,girl 2,0,0,0,,But he's never so much as\N glanced in our direction!
Dialogue: 99,0:06:37.38,0:06:40.63,Dialogue,noble 2,0,0,0,,Then, this beautiful lady is...
Dialogue: 99,0:06:41.67,0:06:45.34,Dialogue,Rishe; internal,0,0,0,,{\i1}Curiosity, jealousy, ulterior motives...
Dialogue: 99,0:06:45.34,0:06:49.06,Dialogue,Rishe; internal,0,0,0,,{\i1}Compared with having my engagement \Nbroken in front of everyone,
Dialogue: 99,0:06:49.06,0:06:51.18,Dialogue,Rishe; internal,0,0,0,,{\i1}this feels like nothing at all.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:53.64,0:06:55.48,Dialogue,Rishe,0,0,0,,I am pleased to meet all of you.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:56.02,0:06:58.81,Dialogue,Rishe,0,0,0,,My name is Rishe Irmgard Weitzner.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:06.91,0:07:10.33,Dialogue,Arnold,0,0,0,,As my future wife has only just arrived from \Nanother country, she has no one to rely on here.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:10.33,0:07:12.08,Dialogue,Arnold,0,0,0,,I would like for you to help her.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:12.08,0:07:14.16,Dialogue,noble 1,0,0,0,,Of course we will!
Dialogue: 99,0:07:20.84,0:07:25.63,Dialogue,Rishe,0,0,0,,"Future wife"? There's no need to \Nprovoke the other ladies that way.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:25.63,0:07:27.93,Dialogue,Arnold,0,0,0,,It's better to make it \Napparent now, while we can.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:28.47,0:07:29.30,Dialogue,Rishe,0,0,0,,Make what apparent?
Dialogue: 99,0:07:30.35,0:07:34.14,Dialogue,Arnold,0,0,0,,The fact that I will protect \Nyou, no matter what happens.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:34.85,0:07:36.14,Dialogue,Rishe; internal,0,0,0,,{\i1}Protect?
Dialogue: 99,0:07:36.39,0:07:38.06,Dialogue,Rishe; internal,0,0,0,,{\i1}Did he just say "protect"?
Dialogue: 99,0:07:38.06,0:07:39.73,Dialogue,Rishe; internal,0,0,0,,{\i1}Arnold Hein?
Dialogue: 99,0:07:40.19,0:07:43.28,Dialogue,Rishe; internal,0,0,0,,{\i1}The man who killed me?
Dialogue: 99,0:07:44.61,0:07:47.91,Dialogue,Rishe,0,0,0,,Your Highness is probably the \None who is most dangerous to me.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:47.91,0:07:49.28,Dialogue,Arnold,0,0,0,,In what sense?
Dialogue: 99,0:07:50.83,0:07:53.74,Dialogue,Rishe,0,0,0,,Well, I don't think I could \Nmatch you in swordplay.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:54.29,0:07:57.62,Dialogue,Arnold,0,0,0,,It might be worthwhile for me to \Ntry sparring with you one day.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:57.62,0:08:00.00,Dialogue,Rishe,0,0,0,,I would like that very much!
Dialogue: 99,0:08:00.00,0:08:03.05,Dialogue,Rishe,0,0,0,,And I know it's asking a lot, but I'd \Nlove to receive training from you!
Dialogue: 99,0:08:05.55,0:08:08.80,Dialogue,Arnold,0,0,0,,You always reply in ways \Nthat exceed my expectations.
Dialogue: 99,0:08:09.72,0:08:14.01,Dialogue,Rishe; internal,0,0,0,,{\i1}I may learn the attack method behind \Nthat fearsome sword technique.
Dialogue: 99,0:08:16.39,0:08:17.81,Dialogue,Arnold,0,0,0,,No need to force yourself to dance.
Dialogue: 99,0:08:18.56,0:08:22.19,Dialogue,Rishe,0,0,0,,Oh, but as I'm here anyway, \NI would like to enjoy myself.
Dialogue: 99,0:08:41.29,0:08:42.75,Dialogue,Rishe; internal,0,0,0,,{\i1}This closeness...
Dialogue: 99,0:08:42.96,0:08:45.21,Dialogue,Rishe; internal,0,0,0,,{\i1}It takes me back to that moment.
Dialogue: 99,0:08:54.51,0:08:56.89,Dialogue,Rishe; internal,0,0,0,,{\i1}Perhaps I'll try playing \Na little trick on him.
Dialogue: 99,0:08:57.73,0:09:01.27,Dialogue,Rishe; internal,0,0,0,,{\i1}If I take the lead, what will he do?
Dialogue: 99,0:09:04.90,0:09:06.40,Dialogue,Rishe; internal,0,0,0,,{\i1}Then, what about this?
Dialogue: 99,0:09:12.07,0:09:15.33,Dialogue,Rishe; internal,0,0,0,,{\i1}He looks like he'd like to say, "No \Nmatter what you do, it's no use."
Dialogue: 99,0:09:23.58,0:09:27.67,Dialogue,Rishe; internal,0,0,0,,{\i1}He's so close, but he hasn't \Ncrossed over into my space at all.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:32.68,0:09:33.43,Dialogue,Rishe; internal,0,0,0,,{\i1}Wait...
Dialogue: 99,0:09:33.97,0:09:36.01,Dialogue,Rishe; internal,0,0,0,,{\i1}Now that I think about it, he's been...
Dialogue: 99,0:09:39.35,0:09:41.94,Dialogue,Rishe; internal,0,0,0,,{\i1}No. Back then, too, the whole time, he was...
Dialogue: 99,0:09:56.83,0:09:57.91,Dialogue,Rishe; internal,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'm going to fall!
Dialogue: 99,0:10:06.29,0:10:08.30,Dialogue,noble 1,0,0,0,,That was splendid!
Dialogue: 99,0:10:08.30,0:10:10.97,Dialogue,noble 2,0,0,0,,The two of you were perfectly \Nin step with each other!
Dialogue: 99,0:10:10.97,0:10:13.80,Dialogue,noble 1,0,0,0,,It was as though I was \Nwatching a sword dance!
Dialogue: 99,0:10:24.90,0:10:26.06,Dialogue,Cornelia,0,0,0,,Lady Rishe?
Dialogue: 99,0:10:26.94,0:10:30.28,Dialogue,Cornelia,0,0,0,,Your dance earlier was quite lovely.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:30.28,0:10:32.19,Dialogue,Rishe,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:32.19,0:10:34.99,Dialogue,Cornelia,0,0,0,,If you'd like, please accept this wine.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:38.24,0:10:39.70,Dialogue,Rishe,0,0,0,,Thank you, I will.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:44.25,0:10:47.21,Dialogue,Rishe; internal,0,0,0,,{\i1}That's the aroma of crushed red peppers.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:47.21,0:10:49.30,Dialogue,Rishe; internal,0,0,0,,{\i1}To think they'd play pranks with food.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:49.63,0:10:52.80,Dialogue,Rishe,0,0,0,,This wine has an unusually striking aroma.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:52.80,0:10:54.55,Dialogue,Rishe,0,0,0,,It's quite intriguing.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:54.55,0:10:58.01,Dialogue,Cornelia,0,0,0,,Are you displeased with \Nthe wine I've brought you?
Dialogue: 99,0:11:03.77,0:11:07.69,Dialogue,Rishe,0,0,0,,As I thought, it has a \Nvery stimulating flavor.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:07.98,0:11:12.11,Dialogue,Rishe,0,0,0,,It makes me very happy to have \Nbeen welcomed in such a way.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:13.65,0:11:14.78,Dialogue,Cornelia,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:23.29,0:11:24.33,Dialogue,Rishe,0,0,0,,That's spicy.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:24.91,0:11:25.75,Dialogue,Arnold,0,0,0,,Spicy?
Dialogue: 99,0:11:26.25,0:11:27.29,Dialogue,Rishe,0,0,0,,Your Highness.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:28.25,0:11:31.00,Dialogue,Rishe,0,0,0,,This wine has peppers in \Nit. It's a special blend.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:32.38,0:11:34.26,Dialogue,Arnold,0,0,0,,You should just throw that away.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:34.42,0:11:39.80,Dialogue,Rishe,0,0,0,,No. This wine has lost its chance \Nto be enjoyed for its flavor.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:39.80,0:11:42.22,Dialogue,Rishe,0,0,0,,The least I can do for it is to drink it all.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:45.31,0:11:46.52,Dialogue,Rishe,0,0,0,,What? Wait!
Dialogue: 99,0:11:47.60,0:11:48.69,Dialogue,Arnold,0,0,0,,Spicy indeed.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:48.69,0:11:50.36,Dialogue,Rishe,0,0,0,,I did say so, didn't I?
Dialogue: 99,0:11:50.90,0:11:52.86,Dialogue,Arnold,0,0,0,,Has this fulfilled your duty to this wine?
Dialogue: 99,0:11:54.57,0:11:55.78,Dialogue,Rishe,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:56.28,0:11:58.24,Dialogue,Rishe,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:59.24,0:12:01.70,Dialogue,Arnold,0,0,0,,What were you thinking \Nabout during our dance?
Dialogue: 99,0:12:01.70,0:12:02.33,Dialogue,Rishe,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 99,0:12:02.70,0:12:06.50,Dialogue,Arnold,0,0,0,,You were thinking of someone\N other than me, weren't you?
Dialogue: 99,0:12:13.46,0:12:17.97,Dialogue,Rishe; internal,0,0,0,,{\i1}I can't tell him it was his future self.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:18.80,0:12:21.39,Dialogue,Rishe,0,0,0,,I was worried for your health, Your Highness.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:24.26,0:12:25.60,Dialogue,Rishe,0,0,0,,This spot...
Dialogue: 99,0:12:25.85,0:12:27.81,Dialogue,Rishe,0,0,0,,You've been wounded there, haven't you?
Dialogue: 99,0:12:30.77,0:12:35.53,Dialogue,Rishe; internal,0,0,0,,{\i1}The movement of his left shoulder is \Nslightly clumsier than that of his right.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:36.74,0:12:38.07,Dialogue,Rishe; internal,0,0,0,,{\i1}It was back then, too.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:46.54,0:12:47.91,Dialogue,Arnold,0,0,0,,It's an old wound.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:47.91,0:12:49.87,Dialogue,Arnold,0,0,0,,It runs all the way along \Nthe top of my shoulder.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:49.87,0:12:52.33,Dialogue,Arnold,0,0,0,,There's a spot where it \Nslightly constricts my skin.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:54.46,0:12:56.26,Dialogue,Rishe,0,0,0,,How horrible.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:56.67,0:12:58.88,Dialogue,Rishe; internal,0,0,0,,{\i1}It's a very old scar.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:59.22,0:13:03.26,Dialogue,Rishe; internal,0,0,0,,{\i1}He was struck with a blade over \Nand over... with killing intent.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:04.89,0:13:07.85,Dialogue,Arnold,0,0,0,,Only a few people know about this scar.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:07.85,0:13:10.31,Dialogue,Arnold,0,0,0,,And no one has ever guessed at its existence.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:10.31,0:13:12.31,Dialogue,Rishe,0,0,0,,Why do you have a scar like this?
Dialogue: 99,0:13:16.07,0:13:17.78,Dialogue,Arnold,0,0,0,,The night wind has grown colder.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:40.80,0:13:43.39,Dialogue,Nichole,0,0,0,,Do you think the lady's \Nmaids will be chosen soon?
Dialogue: 99,0:13:43.39,0:13:43.97,Dialogue,Elsie,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:44.43,0:13:47.97,Dialogue,Nichole,0,0,0,,But with the way things are, \Nwe probably won't be chosen.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:51.89,0:13:53.44,Dialogue,Diana,0,0,0,,Haven't you finished yet?
Dialogue: 99,0:13:53.81,0:13:55.65,Dialogue,Nichole,0,0,0,,I-I'm sorry, Miss Diana!
Dialogue: 99,0:13:55.65,0:13:56.69,Dialogue,Elsie,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:56.69,0:14:00.69,Dialogue,Diana,0,0,0,,And those sheets this morning\N weren't folded the way I taught you.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:00.69,0:14:04.95,Dialogue,Diana,0,0,0,,With skills like that, you'll never be \Nchosen as the crown princess's maids.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:04.95,0:14:06.12,Dialogue,Rishe,0,0,0,,I'll help you.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:08.54,0:14:10.25,Dialogue,Maya,0,0,0,,You again?
Dialogue: 99,0:14:10.25,0:14:12.41,Dialogue,Diana,0,0,0,,I don't know which group you belong to,
Dialogue: 99,0:14:12.41,0:14:14.50,Dialogue,Diana,0,0,0,,but I'm amazed that you have \Nthe time to help others.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:15.00,0:14:17.34,Dialogue,Diana,0,0,0,,And all of you, finish that up quickly.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:19.09,0:14:22.67,Dialogue,Diana,0,0,0,,It seems that the tablecloths \Nfor the villa will arrive today.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:22.67,0:14:25.93,Dialogue,Diana,0,0,0,,If we help with that, I'm certain \Nwe'll be valued more highly.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:26.26,0:14:28.01,Dialogue,Diana,0,0,0,,Let's go. Maya? Laura?
Dialogue: 99,0:14:28.01,0:14:28.93,Dialogue,Maya; Laura,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:31.31,0:14:35.44,Dialogue,Elsie,0,0,0,,I'm sorry. We're just so \Nbad at remembering things.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:35.81,0:14:38.98,Dialogue,Rishe,0,0,0,,You haven't been at the \Npalace very long, have you?
Dialogue: 99,0:14:39.48,0:14:41.86,Dialogue,Rishe,0,0,0,,No one gets everything \Nright in the beginning.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:42.74,0:14:46.82,Dialogue,Rishe; internal,0,0,0,,{\i1}And it isn't that Elsie and the \Nothers are unused to doing laundry.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:46.82,0:14:50.74,Dialogue,Rishe; internal,0,0,0,,{\i1}They're completing their work. It's \Njust taking longer, that's all.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:50.74,0:14:53.16,Dialogue,Rishe; internal,0,0,0,,{\i1}In that, Diana is right.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:53.16,0:14:55.62,Dialogue,Rishe; internal,0,0,0,,{\i1}But the cause of it is very clear.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:55.96,0:14:59.75,Dialogue,Rishe,0,0,0,,Have you heard anything about Miss \NDiana's life from before she came here?
Dialogue: 99,0:15:00.09,0:15:04.05,Dialogue,Elsie,0,0,0,,I think I heard that she's from a \Nwealthy family that has several shops.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:04.05,0:15:06.05,Dialogue,Nichole,0,0,0,,I've heard that, too.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:06.05,0:15:10.56,Dialogue,Nichole,0,0,0,,But they lost it all because \Nthey went into debt.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:10.56,0:15:11.64,Dialogue,Rishe,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:19.57,0:15:21.40,Dialogue,Diana,0,0,0,,It's sparklingly clean.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:21.40,0:15:22.82,Dialogue,Diana,0,0,0,,When did that happen?
Dialogue: 99,0:15:22.82,0:15:24.82,Dialogue,Diana,0,0,0,,I wonder who did the cleaning here.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:25.40,0:15:29.07,Dialogue,Maya,0,0,0,,And that girl who always turns \Nup uninvited isn't here, is she?
Dialogue: 99,0:15:29.07,0:15:30.87,Dialogue,Laura,0,0,0,,An upstart newcomer like her?
Dialogue: 99,0:15:30.87,0:15:32.58,Dialogue,Laura,0,0,0,,Of course she wouldn't be here.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:32.58,0:15:37.12,Dialogue,Diana,0,0,0,,Indeed. To serve the crown princess, \Nmanners are absolutely essential.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:37.58,0:15:39.04,Dialogue,Nichole,0,0,0,,My heart's pounding. Is yours?
Dialogue: 99,0:15:39.04,0:15:39.88,Dialogue,Elsie,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:39.88,0:15:42.55,Dialogue,Nichole,0,0,0,,What do you think the crown princess is like?
Dialogue: 99,0:15:44.84,0:15:46.68,Dialogue,Oliver,0,0,0,,Lady Rishe is here.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:12.95,0:16:15.62,Dialogue,Rishe,0,0,0,,I am Rishe Irmgard Weitzner.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:18.67,0:16:20.04,Dialogue,Rishe; internal,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:20.04,0:16:22.54,Dialogue,Rishe; internal,0,0,0,,{\i1}I wanted to learn the truth \Nabout your situations,
Dialogue: 99,0:16:22.54,0:16:25.71,Dialogue,Rishe; internal,0,0,0,,{\i1}and I thought that speaking to you as a \Nfellow maid was the best way to do it.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:26.38,0:16:29.55,Dialogue,Rishe,0,0,0,,Now, I will read off some names.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:30.14,0:16:31.68,Dialogue,Rishe,0,0,0,,Miss Marguerite.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:31.97,0:16:32.97,Dialogue,Rishe,0,0,0,,Miss Elsie.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:33.68,0:16:34.68,Dialogue,Rishe,0,0,0,,Miss Nichole.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:35.14,0:16:36.18,Dialogue,Rishe,0,0,0,,Miss Rosa.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:36.18,0:16:37.23,Dialogue,Rishe,0,0,0,,Miss Hilde.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:37.64,0:16:38.77,Dialogue,Rishe,0,0,0,,Miss Amelia.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:39.31,0:16:42.81,Dialogue,Rishe,0,0,0,,These people will be my maids.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:42.81,0:16:43.52,Dialogue,Diana,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 99,0:16:43.52,0:16:45.57,Dialogue,Rishe,0,0,0,,I look forward to getting to know you better.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:45.57,0:16:48.15,Dialogue,Oliver,0,0,0,,Now, everyone whose names \Nhave been called, come to—
Dialogue: 99,0:16:48.15,0:16:49.99,Dialogue,Diana,0,0,0,,But why, Lady Rishe?
Dialogue: 99,0:16:49.99,0:16:51.99,Dialogue,Diana,0,0,0,,Everyone you've chosen is new!
Dialogue: 99,0:16:51.99,0:16:54.28,Dialogue,Diana,0,0,0,,We have more experience as maids!
Dialogue: 99,0:16:54.28,0:16:54.99,Dialogue,Oliver,0,0,0,,Disrespectful.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:54.99,0:16:56.08,Dialogue,Rishe,0,0,0,,It's all right.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:57.04,0:16:59.41,Dialogue,Diana,0,0,0,,Yes, what I am saying is disrespectful!
Dialogue: 99,0:16:59.41,0:17:02.79,Dialogue,Diana,0,0,0,,But please look at our \Nabilities as maids!
Dialogue: 99,0:17:03.00,0:17:04.38,Dialogue,Rishe,0,0,0,,Miss Diana.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:04.38,0:17:05.17,Dialogue,Diana,0,0,0,,Yes?
Dialogue: 99,0:17:05.59,0:17:08.67,Dialogue,Rishe,0,0,0,,As of today, you will no longer \Nhold the position of maid.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:08.92,0:17:09.76,Dialogue,Diana,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 99,0:17:10.88,0:17:12.01,Dialogue,Diana,0,0,0,,But that's...
Dialogue: 99,0:17:15.39,0:17:19.14,Dialogue,Rishe,0,0,0,,Say, Diana? When you \Nfirst came to the palace,
Dialogue: 99,0:17:19.14,0:17:21.69,Dialogue,Rishe,0,0,0,,can you remember what you \Nhad the most trouble with?
Dialogue: 99,0:17:22.27,0:17:25.44,Dialogue,Rishe,0,0,0,,Were you able to complete your work the \Nway you do now right from the start?
Dialogue: 99,0:17:26.36,0:17:28.69,Dialogue,Diana,0,0,0,,No. In the beginning...
Dialogue: 99,0:17:29.11,0:17:32.03,Dialogue,Diana,0,0,0,,it was difficult for me to \Nunderstand how things were done.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:32.82,0:17:35.70,Dialogue,Diana,0,0,0,,I couldn't remember after \Nbeing told only once.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:36.08,0:17:38.87,Dialogue,Diana,0,0,0,,But everyone who had been \Nthere longer was so busy.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:38.87,0:17:42.37,Dialogue,Diana,0,0,0,,They'd say, "I don't have time to \Nteach you, so watch and remember."
Dialogue: 99,0:17:43.21,0:17:46.59,Dialogue,Diana,0,0,0,,Even so, I've grown into a \Nvery competent maid!
Dialogue: 99,0:17:46.59,0:17:48.21,Dialogue,Diana,0,0,0,,I'm not like those girls!
Dialogue: 99,0:17:48.42,0:17:53.30,Dialogue,Rishe,0,0,0,,You're right. There is one way in which \Nyou are very different from those girls.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:53.59,0:17:54.55,Dialogue,Diana,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 99,0:17:54.76,0:17:57.68,Dialogue,Rishe,0,0,0,,You can read and write.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:59.60,0:18:03.60,Dialogue,Rishe,0,0,0,,You were born into a merchant's family \Nand received a good education,
Dialogue: 99,0:18:03.60,0:18:07.94,Dialogue,Rishe,0,0,0,,but there are very few ordinary people \Nwho have had the same sort of education.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:07.94,0:18:12.70,Dialogue,Rishe,0,0,0,,You could write down what those with more \Nexperience told you and read it again later.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:13.32,0:18:15.24,Dialogue,Rishe,0,0,0,,But what if you hadn't been able do that?
Dialogue: 99,0:18:17.24,0:18:20.79,Dialogue,Diana,0,0,0,,Go and line them up the way I \Nshowed you yesterday please.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:20.79,0:18:21.66,Dialogue,Elsie,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 99,0:18:22.12,0:18:26.38,Dialogue,Diana,0,0,0,,And those sheets this morning\N weren't folded the way I taught you.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:29.00,0:18:33.63,Dialogue,Diana,0,0,0,,When my family went bankrupt, we lost \Neverything. There was no one to protect me.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:34.63,0:18:37.64,Dialogue,Diana,0,0,0,,Even so, I made myself into a lady's maid.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:37.64,0:18:40.64,Dialogue,Diana,0,0,0,,I kept wondering, why \Ncouldn't all of you do it?
Dialogue: 99,0:18:41.89,0:18:45.27,Dialogue,Diana,0,0,0,,But it's because I didn't teach you properly.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:48.02,0:18:49.32,Dialogue,Diana,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:50.03,0:18:52.15,Dialogue,Diana,0,0,0,,I was the one in the wrong.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:53.90,0:18:56.49,Dialogue,Diana,0,0,0,,I'm really so very sorry.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:57.07,0:19:00.24,Dialogue,Nichole,0,0,0,,Lady Rishe, Miss Diana is very skilled, \Nand she always works her hardest!
Dialogue: 99,0:19:00.24,0:19:02.45,Dialogue,Elsie,0,0,0,,Please don't make her quit.
Dialogue: 99,0:19:03.33,0:19:07.92,Dialogue,Diana,0,0,0,,Thank you, but it only makes \Nsense that I wasn't chosen.
Dialogue: 99,0:19:08.17,0:19:09.29,Dialogue,Elsie,0,0,0,,Miss Diana...
Dialogue: 99,0:19:15.01,0:19:17.64,Dialogue,Rishe,0,0,0,,There's something I'd like to ask of you.
Dialogue: 99,0:19:18.26,0:19:23.60,Dialogue,Rishe,0,0,0,,I'd like to make this villa into \Na training ground for new maids.
Dialogue: 99,0:19:23.98,0:19:28.11,Dialogue,Rishe,0,0,0,,While they're learning household skills, \NI'd also like them to learn their letters.
Dialogue: 99,0:19:28.77,0:19:31.02,Dialogue,Rishe,0,0,0,,If they learn to read and \Nwrite along with their work,
Dialogue: 99,0:19:31.02,0:19:33.65,Dialogue,Rishe,0,0,0,,wherever they go, whatever their situation, \Nit will be an asset to them.
Dialogue: 99,0:19:34.32,0:19:39.07,Dialogue,Rishe,0,0,0,,Even if they find they must begin a whole \Nnew life, it's sure to prove useful.
Dialogue: 99,0:19:39.57,0:19:44.33,Dialogue,Rishe,0,0,0,,Diana, I'd like for you to help me \Ncreate their teaching materials.
Dialogue: 99,0:19:44.87,0:19:46.00,Dialogue,Diana,0,0,0,,Me?
Dialogue: 99,0:19:47.25,0:19:50.42,Dialogue,Diana,0,0,0,,Even though I said all of \Nthose disrespectful things?
Dialogue: 99,0:19:51.50,0:19:53.38,Dialogue,Rishe,0,0,0,,Why, whatever could you be speaking of?
Dialogue: 99,0:19:53.80,0:19:55.63,Dialogue,Rishe,0,0,0,,Will you help me?
Dialogue: 99,0:19:56.63,0:19:58.68,Dialogue,Diana,0,0,0,,Yes, it would be my pleasure.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:01.39,0:20:02.56,Dialogue,Albert,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:02.85,0:20:04.52,Dialogue,Oliver,0,0,0,,Is it as you predicted?
Dialogue: 99,0:20:04.52,0:20:05.52,Dialogue,Albert,0,0,0,,Of course not.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:06.06,0:20:09.10,Dialogue,Albert,0,0,0,,Though I did think she'd \Ncreate some sort of havoc.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:09.10,0:20:13.19,Dialogue,Oliver,0,0,0,,Showing your amusement too openly is \Ndisrespectful toward your future wife.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:13.44,0:20:16.78,Dialogue,Oliver,0,0,0,,Though, I may end up \Nenjoying myself as well...
Dialogue: 99,0:20:16.78,0:20:20.66,Dialogue,Oliver,0,0,0,,wondering what sorts of things she \Nwill accomplish in this country.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:20.66,0:20:21.49,Dialogue,Arnold,0,0,0,,Oliver.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:22.53,0:20:27.29,Dialogue,Arnold,0,0,0,,I didn't bring Rishe here to be my wife to \Nbenefit the imperial family or the nation.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:28.29,0:20:31.84,Dialogue,Diana,0,0,0,,As for the first words they'll learn, what \Ndo you think about cleaning implements?
Dialogue: 99,0:20:32.34,0:20:34.13,Dialogue,Diana,0,0,0,,Since they're used every day,
Dialogue: 99,0:20:34.13,0:20:37.59,Dialogue,Diana,0,0,0,,I thought everyone might be able to \Nsee how useful it is to memorize them.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:37.59,0:20:39.97,Dialogue,Rishe,0,0,0,,Yes, I think that's a very good idea.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:39.97,0:20:41.30,Dialogue,Diana,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:42.05,0:20:43.43,Dialogue,Diana,0,0,0,,Lady Rishe...
Dialogue: 99,0:20:43.43,0:20:48.52,Dialogue,Diana,0,0,0,,Thinking of the best ways to \Nteach everyone is so much fun!
Dialogue: 99,0:20:48.73,0:20:50.35,Dialogue,Rishe,0,0,0,,I'm glad to hear that.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:52.02,0:20:53.27,Dialogue,Elsie,0,0,0,,Excuse me.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:53.48,0:20:55.78,Dialogue,Elsie,0,0,0,,Lady Rishe, you must get ready soon.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:55.78,0:20:56.69,Dialogue,Rishe,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:57.11,0:20:59.20,Dialogue,Diana,0,0,0,,Then, I'll take my leave here.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:59.20,0:21:00.28,Dialogue,Rishe,0,0,0,,I'm counting on you.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:00.99,0:21:05.58,Dialogue,Elsie,0,0,0,,Oh, Miss Diana? After dinner, \Nwill you help me study some more?
Dialogue: 99,0:21:05.58,0:21:06.50,Dialogue,Diana,0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:06.79,0:21:08.29,Dialogue,Elsie,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:11.46,0:21:12.75,Dialogue,Elsie,0,0,0,,What a lovely dress.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:13.08,0:21:15.17,Dialogue,Rishe,0,0,0,,It's the most valuable one I have.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:15.88,0:21:18.72,Dialogue,Rishe,0,0,0,,Will you help me put up my \Nhair in a style to match?
Dialogue: 99,0:21:18.72,0:21:19.47,Dialogue,Elsie,0,0,0,,Yes, my lady.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:21.34,0:21:25.22,Dialogue,Elsie,0,0,0,,Um, I've heard that your guest is a merchant.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:25.22,0:21:28.93,Dialogue,Elsie,0,0,0,,Is your most valuable dress really necessary?
Dialogue: 99,0:21:28.93,0:21:33.48,Dialogue,Rishe,0,0,0,,Well, it's one potential ingredient, you see?
Dialogue: 99,0:21:33.48,0:21:34.94,Dialogue,Elsie,0,0,0,,Ingredient?
Dialogue: 99,0:21:34.94,0:21:40.95,Dialogue,Rishe; internal,0,0,0,,{\i1}After all, these are the people who drilled \Nwhat it is to be a merchant into me.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:41.24,0:21:46.20,Dialogue,Rishe; internal,0,0,0,,{\i1}If I can gain them as allies, then my choices\N moving forward increase dramatically.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:46.83,0:21:50.16,Dialogue,Rishe; internal,0,0,0,,{\i1}The Aria Trading Company has \Nonly just been established.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:50.16,0:21:53.00,Dialogue,Rishe; internal,0,0,0,,{\i1}A business negotiation with the \Nimperial family of Galkhein...
Dialogue: 99,0:21:53.00,0:21:55.96,Dialogue,Rishe; internal,0,0,0,,{\i1}that's something they should want \Nto be successful, no matter what.
Dialogue: 99,0:22:00.55,0:22:04.97,Dialogue,Rishe; internal,0,0,0,,{\i1}Would dressing more gaudily make me seem \Nmore like a mark who loves to spend money?
Dialogue: 99,0:22:05.18,0:22:07.14,Dialogue,Elsie,0,0,0,,I think it's a shame.
Dialogue: 99,0:22:07.14,0:22:10.52,Dialogue,Elsie,0,0,0,,Putting your hair in a bun with some \Ntrailing tendrils would give you a refined air.
Dialogue: 99,0:22:10.52,0:22:12.60,Dialogue,Elsie,0,0,0,,I feel it would match this dress better.
Dialogue: 99,0:22:12.60,0:22:14.40,Dialogue,Rishe,0,0,0,,Thank you, Elsie.
Dialogue: 99,0:22:14.40,0:22:17.07,Dialogue,Rishe,0,0,0,,But this outfit is for my battle today.
Dialogue: 99,0:22:17.07,0:22:18.48,Dialogue,Elsie,0,0,0,,Battle?
Dialogue: 99,0:22:19.44,0:22:20.99,Dialogue,Kamil,0,0,0,,Your guest has arrived.
Dialogue: 99,0:22:25.53,0:22:29.08,Dialogue,Tully,0,0,0,,Allow me to congratulate you \Non your upcoming nuptials.
Dialogue: 99,0:22:31.66,0:22:35.58,Dialogue,Tully,0,0,0,,I am Kaine Tully, from \Nthe Aria Trading Company.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.60,0:22:53.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,
